	(text_box "(LED forward voltage) Vf = 2.0V (very liberal estimate here, likely to be lower)\n(Pullup resistor) Rp = 10k\n(LED resistor) Rl = 2.2k\n\nREQUIREMENTS:\n(LED current) 0.3mA < I_LED < 0.6mA\n(Enable pin HIGH threshold) VIH_EN = 1.03V (max value from datasheet)\n(Power good sink current) I_PG = 1mA (recommended from datasheet)\n\nEnsuring LED current within margin:\nI_LEDmax = (8.4 - Vf) / (Rp + Rl) = 0.52mA\nI_LEDmin = (6.0 - Vf) / (Rp + Rl) = 0.32mA\n\nEnsuring PG signal > VIH_EN:\nV_PGmax = 8.4 - (I_LEDmax * Rp) = 3.2V\nV_PGmin = 6.0 - (I_LEDmin * Rp) = 2.8V\n\nAssume worst case Vf of 0V (not possible but if the above requirements are met here than Vf is irrelavant):\nI_LEDworst = (6.0 - 0) / (Rp + Rl) = 0.49mA\nV_PGworst = 6.0 - (I_LEDworst * Rp) = 1.082V\n\nEnsuring sink current within margin:\nI_PG = 8.4 / Rp = 0.84mA"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 207.01 110.8106 0)
		(size 76.2 53.0194)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
			(color 0 0 194 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 0 0 194 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ea6a4b0e-44cf-4780-aa52-20dc9c82bca8")
	)
